Objective:
Design the technical architecture of LegalEase and integrate an appropriate Generative AI model for generating structured legal documents such as contracts, NDAs, agreements, and other legal templates.

Selected AI Model: Gemini 2.5 Pro

Primary Goal:
Create a secure, modular architecture in which user requirements are collected, validated, processed by the Generative AI model, and transformed into structured, downloadable legal documents.

