The database allows users to save, edit, retrieve, and regenerate documents.

6. Document Generation Layer
After Gemini generates and the backend validates the structured content, the Document Generation Service converts it into a professional document.

Gemini JSON
     ↓
Content Validator
     ↓
Template Engine
     ↓
DOCX / PDF

The template engine controls:

Document title

Headings

Numbering

Paragraph formatting

Page layout

Signature blocks

Headers/footers

This separation is important because the AI should generate the legal content while the application controls the final document formatting.

7. Security Architecture
Because LegalEase processes potentially sensitive legal information, security should be part of the architecture.

Security controls
HTTPS/TLS communication

Secure authentication

Password hashing

Role-based authorization

Encryption of sensitive data

Secure API-key storage

Input validation

Output validation

Access control for documents

Audit logging

Secure deletion mechanisms

The Gemini API key should remain on the backend and never be exposed in frontend JavaScript.

